  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Terms of References for youth entrepreneurship programming Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on a study, the Dutch Embassy in Zimbabwe has asked for the development of Terms of References for three project proposals to strengthen youth entrepreneurship in Zimbabwe, on the following subjects:1.	Capacity building on financial literacy, mentorship and lobby and advocacy support, especially concerning the start-up act; 2.	Institutional support of a youth organization, institutional support in Mutare and Bulawayo to effectively represent the youth in business in policy dialogue; 3.	Incubation of youth-owned business with an inclusion of market linkages activities.</narrative>
  </description>
